        <title type="html"><![CDATA[cuda版本更新]]></title>
        <id>https://Sunburst7.github.io/blog/2025/08/23/更新cuda</id>
        <link href="https://Sunburst7.github.io/blog/2025/08/23/更新cuda"/>
        <updated>2025-08-23T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[参考：]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-info admonition_xJq3 alert alert--info"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7 2.3c3.14 0 5.7 2.56 5.7 5.7s-2.56 5.7-5.7 5.7A5.71 5.71 0 0 1 1.3 8c0-3.14 2.56-5.7 5.7-5.7zM7 1C3.14 1 0 4.14 0 8s3.14 7 7 7 7-3.14 7-7-3.14-7-7-7zm1 3H6v5h2V4zm0 6H6v2h2v-2z"></path></svg></span>info</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p>参考：
<a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/685593441" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">博客1</a></p></div></div>
<p>服务器的cuda toolkit版本是11.8，有点太久了，想要更新一下。使用nvidia-smi查看支持版本、</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="alt text" src="data:image/png;base64," width="1042" height="83" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>去官方网站寻找对应版本：<a href="https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-toolkit-archive" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-toolkit-archive</a></p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="alt text" src="https://sunburst7.github.io/assets/images/8-23-kit-info-e49bcfb5452ca0db05344c39fd1a501c.png" width="1773" height="1010" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">wget https://developer.download.nvidia.com/compute/cuda/12.8.1/local_installers/cuda_12.8.1_570.124.06_linux.run</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sudo sh cuda_12.8.1_570.124.06_linux.run</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>这里按空格取消一下</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="alt text" src="https://sunburst7.github.io/assets/images/8-23-panel-065050ef28f55fe047bef2d6a018d1ef.png" width="1049" height="745" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>中间有一步提示替换当前的cuda环境，可以选是，这样不用再手动配置PATH，安装完成后提示</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="alt text" src="https://sunburst7.github.io/assets/images/8-23-finish-0341b2c8a57fd0df5964722a5f4021a2.png" width="1959" height="569" class="img_ev3q"></p>]]></content>
