    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[nvidia驱动安装]]></title>
        <id>https://Sunburst7.github.io/blog/2025/08/13/服务器nvidia驱动版本不匹配 copy</id>
        <link href="https://Sunburst7.github.io/blog/2025/08/13/服务器nvidia驱动版本不匹配 copy"/>
        <updated>2025-08-13T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[参考：]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-info admonition_xJq3 alert alert--info"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7 2.3c3.14 0 5.7 2.56 5.7 5.7s-2.56 5.7-5.7 5.7A5.71 5.71 0 0 1 1.3 8c0-3.14 2.56-5.7 5.7-5.7zM7 1C3.14 1 0 4.14 0 8s3.14 7 7 7 7-3.14 7-7-3.14-7-7-7zm1 3H6v5h2V4zm0 6H6v2h2v-2z"></path></svg></span>info</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p>参考：
<a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/685593441" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">博客1</a>
<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/qq_39779233/article/details/127200644" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">博客2</a></p></div></div>
<p>起因：同门安装EGL时错误的安装了版本不匹配的nvidia驱动，导致使用显卡报错 <strong>Failed to initialize NVML: Driver/library version mismatch</strong></p>
<p>先查询系统推荐的nvidia driver版本</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ubuntu-drivers devices</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://sunburst7.github.io/assets/images/8-13-driver-version-0c1e85550c937dee5f8aa233e3b40375.png" width="2102" height="641" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>安装 nvidia 驱动</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sudo apt install nvidia-driver-570</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>安装完成重启即可</p>]]></content>
